@startuml
title Phase 11 — console-postreq — summary

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

start

:11.1 plan and scope (branch ph11-postreq -> dev; tracker milestone v1 - phases 11-12);

partition "Deferred modules delivered" {
  :#43 sync: single-node node registry, /nodes + /sync/status (ADR-0154);
  :#44 obsv: durable journals, sanitize, replay/subscribe, reports, codex;
  :#45 visualizer: replay/live over obsv, memory browse, /visualizer/*;
  :#46 registry: teams/routines/policies stores, memory-backed, /teams|/routines|/policies;
  :#47 lifecycle: typed states, cancellation, events, /workers;
  :#48 A8: routingDecision over RPC, python policy retired (ADR-0151);
}

:11.8 summary + close out issues;
:revu --profile pr (static-only): 0 findings; archtest clean;

stop

note right
  Compose into app/ (control plane).
  Gates: gofmt/build/vet/test,
  python pytest/ruff/mypy,
  archtest, control-plane httptest,
  revu (bot-authored, static-only).
  Deferred: multi-machine sync, desktop.
end note

@enduml
